  "Id": "e44dccac-69b6-5a5c-9396-411445c408f0"/*VolumeNanoVdbBoxExample*/,
  "Description": "Fire, smoke and liquid in a glass box, raymarched on the GPU from NanoVDB buffers.\n\nThree volumes are generated and animated on the CPU: a sloshing liquid slab, a flame capsule and a smoke sphere, each displaced by [VolumeNoise]. [VolumeToNanoVdb] flattens every one into a NanoVDB buffer and [NanoVdbRender] walks the trees in HLSL to draw all three inside the box.",
